        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1531_5527.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willig</unclear> dienst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuuor</unclear>, Er-
<lb n="2"/>samen und weysen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> lieben und
<lb n="3"/>gueten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freund</unclear>.
<lb n="4"/>Was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> unns <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Luechman</unclear></persName> von <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sumnaw</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="5"/>in der <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abbtey</unclear> Sanct Gallen</orgName> gelegen: und
<lb n="6"/><persName resp="#ner">Ursula <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Klothaerin</unclear></persName>, sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ehaewyb</unclear>, alls <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geweste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgerin</unclear>, aines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>.
<lb n="8"/>Statt begerenden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weytern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Beysitzes</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halber</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">under</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thaenig</unclear> suppliciert und gebetten: Das haben
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieselben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ingeschloßener</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irer</unclear> unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">übergebener</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>supplication, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehreren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Innhallts</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuuernemen</unclear>.
<lb n="12"/>Wann wir dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿe</unclear> supplicanten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irem</unclear> gueten
<lb n="13"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolfarth</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubefürdern</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuuerhelffen</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>willig und genaigt: Alls haben wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inen</unclear>, das be-
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürschreiben</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verwaigern</unclear> oder abschlagen
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soellen</unclear>.
<lb n="17"/>Unnd gelangt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierauf</unclear> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>. unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freund</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/>nachbarlichs ersuechen und bitten, die woellen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inen</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">supplicierenden</unclear>, den gebettenen Beysitz, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auf</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eruol</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">worthallten</unclear>, nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelegenhait</unclear>,
<lb n="21"/>günstigklich verwilligen.
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> also gegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inen</unclear> supplicanten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dermassen</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> erzaigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> beweysen, wie zue <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>.
<lb n="24"/>unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freund</unclear>- und nachbarlichs ver-
<lb n="25"/>trawen steht. Unnd damit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿe</unclear> diser unnser
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Inen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolgemainten</unclear> Intercession fruchtbar-
<lb n="27"/>lich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genossen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuhaben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">spüren</unclear> und sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßen</unclear> be-
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ruehmen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erfraewen</unclear> moegen: Das umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wht</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1531_5528.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/>seyen wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>- und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nachberlich</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubeschulden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerwidren</unclear> geneigt, Goetlichen
<lb n="31"/>schirm uns damit zumall anbefelhende, datum
<lb n="32"/><origDate when="1606-12-29" resp="#ner">29. decembris, ablaeuffenden 1606</origDate>. Jhars.
<lb n="33"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rath
<lb n="34"/>der Statt Lindaw</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1531_5529.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="35"/>Edel, ehrenvest, fürsichtig, ersam unndt weyß,
<lb n="36"/>gebietendt günstige herren.
<lb n="37"/>Dieselben thuondt wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underschribne</unclear> supplicanten,
<lb n="38"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> supplication <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underthenig</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoersuochen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umbgehn</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">höchstfleißigem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">de=</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müetigem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demselben</unclear> gnedig zuo=
<lb n="41"/>vernemen, unnd mit pittender hilff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerscheinen</unclear>.
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gebietendt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstige</unclear> herren. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underschribne</unclear> sup=
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">plicantin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geweßte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitburgerin</unclear>,
<lb n="44"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ursula</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bluetschärin</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weylundt</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Conrat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bluetschärs</unclear></persName>
<lb n="45"/>derselben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitburgers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seligen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachgelaßne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dochter</unclear>,
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hab</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnelangst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> mit <persName resp="#ner">Jacoben Buochman</persName>,
<lb n="47"/>vonn <placeName resp="#ner">Summaerau</placeName>, inn der statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sanct Gallen</placeName> eelich
<lb n="48"/>verheürat, unndt bey 20. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuchen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochzeyt</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehallten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Daselbsten</unclear> wir unnß dann, uff Ehrnge=
<lb n="50"/>dachter herren vonn <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sanct Gallen</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstiges</unclear>
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlauben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bishero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffennthallten</unclear>. Wir haben
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußlendische</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">personen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">khein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bleibende</unclear>
<lb n="53"/>statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daselbsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuowohnen</unclear>, es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> dann
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dasselbig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vonnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnaden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogelaßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellches</unclear>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnzweifenlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desto</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschehe</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>.
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intercedendo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schriben</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedachte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sanct</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsertwegen</unclear>
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuochen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unndt</unclear> pitten wurden, unß bede
<lb n="59"/>ehegemecht, alß die wir unnß daselbsten, ohne
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1531_5530.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="60"/>schueng zuemellten, erbar, redlich unnd wol verhallten,
<lb n="61"/>verner, so lanng es einem ehrs. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Rhat der statt Sanct
<lb n="62"/>Gallen</orgName> gelegen, unnd wir unns gehorsam verhalltten,
<lb n="63"/>freig sitzes zuelassen etc.
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Deßwegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beeden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eegemeßten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>-
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thenig</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fueßfellig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitt</unclear> e. e. f. e. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wt</unclear>.
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnßerwegen</unclear>, an obgedachte <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">herren Burg-
<lb n="67"/>maister unnd Rhat der statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>
<lb n="68"/>intercedendo schryben, unnd sy an Inen dienst.
<lb n="69"/>freünt. unnd nachparlich ersuechen und pitten,
<lb n="70"/>das sy unns noch verner, wie bißher beschehen,
<lb n="71"/>Inn allen gnaden haben und halltten, unnd den
<lb n="72"/>freigsitz, so lanng es den selben gelegen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günnstig</unclear>
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitthailen</unclear>: wellen wir unns dermaßßen gehor-
<lb n="74"/>samblich unnd aller gebür nach verhalltten,
<lb n="75"/>das unnßertwegen ainiche clag erscheinen solle.
<lb n="76"/>Sollche unns hierdurch erzaigende gnad unnd
<lb n="77"/>guetthat, gegen Gott dem allmechtig umb
<lb n="78"/>fristüng e. e. f. e. wt. langes leben, glüeekh-
<lb n="79"/>liche regierung, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alle</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolfart</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerbitten</unclear>,
<lb n="80"/>wellen wir Inn unnßerm täglichen gebett
<lb n="81"/>ohnvergeßßen bleyben.
<lb n="82"/>Denselben unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gunsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüwlich</unclear>
<lb n="83"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevellchent</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebettner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willfahr</unclear> er-
<lb n="84"/>warttenndt.
<lb n="85"/>E. e. f. e. wt.
<lb n="86"/>underthenige
<lb n="87"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kuchmaister</unclear></persName>
<lb n="88"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Leinweber</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear>
<lb n="89"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Urßula</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schobßlerin</unclear></persName>, sein ehewirtin.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1531_5531.jpg" n="5"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1531_5532.jpg" n="6"/>
<lb n="90"/>Underthenige supplication.
<lb n="91"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ahn</unclear> herren <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister unnd
<lb n="92"/>Rhat der Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lindauw</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="93"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacoben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Laduchmans</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usz</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pommeren</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="94"/>unnd <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Ursula <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Glattharin</unclear></persName>, seiner
<lb n="95"/>ehlich hauszfrauwen.
<lb n="96"/>Pro intercessione.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1531_5533.jpg" n="7"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1531_5534.jpg" n="8"/>
<lb n="97"/>Den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersamen</unclear> und wisen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und
<lb n="98"/>Rhat der statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besondern</unclear>
<lb n="99"/>lieben und gueten fründen.
<lb n="100"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sanct Gallen</placeName>.
</p>
